expect-exit: 0
expect-stderr: empty
oracle: exit-status stdout-text refs-bytes
outcome: full
severity: interop
spec: format-reference.md#revision-syntax
note: the same 64 characters in uppercase are a branch name to both, so each
 writes `refs/heads/<BRANCH>` and prints the commit it made. The normalizer
 masks each side's own checksum, so `stdout-text` states that both printed one
 and `refs-bytes` that both wrote the ref file holding it.

